<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτοκ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκος</span> I) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>near childbirth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Superf.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				306
			</span></i> (condemned by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				310
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				573a2
			</span></i>, etc.: heterocl. acc. sg. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίτοκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).1390.33
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Andania</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fruitful, having borne children,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.8.32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκος</span> II) <i>bearing interest upon
				interest,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόκοι ἐ.</span>
			<i>compound</i> interest, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				842d
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
